{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "見思惑者，\n即見愛煩惱。見煩惱者，邪心觀理，名之曰見。若於假實之理情迷，而倒想邪求，隨見偏理，妄執為實，通名\n為見。即五利使見諦所斷八十八使，及六十二見也。愛煩惱者，貪染之心，名之為愛。若於假實二事情迷，\n隨心所對一切事境，染著纏綿，通名為愛。即五鈍使思惟所斷十使，及所斷結流愛扼纏盖纏等也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "士夫即作者，以心能造物，故名\n作者。六界謂地、水、火、風、空、識，六法各別，故名為界。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "主是俱生我，無分別故，屬第七識我。宰是分別我，有斷割故，屬第六\n識我。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
