{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生空即眾生空。若觀生死苦果，但見名色、陰、界、入實法從因緣\n生，新新生滅，是實法中空，無我、人、眾生、壽者等十六知見，如龜毛、兔角，畢竟不可得，是名眾生空。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
