{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如立非一以顯一，立一以顯非一，謂之表。今既雙非，復何\n所表"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如立非一以遮一，立非異以遮異，既為遮過而設，不\n得更有所執"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遮則非表，表則非遮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "既非遮表，徒成謔談"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此以上俱舍本文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "斷就惡言，勤就善言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此翻眼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "現受用是假法，今但破無為非實，故此不揀"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "對前開四，故今云合，謂意處全\n及法處一分。適公曰：「意所取境，名之為法。」法處有四：一、心所，二、不相應行，三、無為，四、無表色。今指心所一\n分，故云半也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "對前合色為一，為開也。謂色、聲、香、味、觸及眼、耳、鼻、舌、身全\n為十。言半者，即法處中無表色"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂開色為十半，如前開心為七半，即六識為六意根及法處心所也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九根和合，信法二人見諦中未知欲\n知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "信解見得二人思惟中九根和合轉名根"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至無學中九根轉名\n知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《瑜伽》三有二種變異性：一、異性，變異性由有相似生\n故；二、變性，變異性由不相似生故。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上生人天猶如漂草，下沉三塗猶如溺魚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五停\n心者：一、多貪眾生不淨觀，二、多嗔眾生慈悲觀，三、多散眾生數息觀，四、愚癡眾生因緣觀，五、多障眾生念\n佛觀。別相念、總相念者，謂四念處：一、觀身不淨，二、觀受是苦，三、觀心無常，四、觀法無我。若各觀察，則名別\n相念。若總觀察，則名總相念。三界者，欲界、色界、無色界也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如木鑽火，未見火出，先得煖相。以喻加行位人，未見智火，已得煖相。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀行轉明，如登山頂，悉皆明了。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "忍即忍可之義。謂於苦、集、滅、道四諦之法，忍可而樂修也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於理雖未能證，而於世間最勝。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "初果即須陀洹也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "第二果即斯陀含，第三果即阿那含也。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語阿羅漢，華言無學，又云無生。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "分段生死者，隨因緣力，壽命短長，有定齊限，故名分段。變\n易生死者，由悲願力，改轉身命，無定齊限，故名變易。如改麤身為細質，易短壽作長年，覺知報盡為死，入\n定還資為生。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂於聖法\n不得名異生性"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即身即浮塵根"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蘊有三種：一者一念頃蘊，謂一剎那有生滅法；二者一期生蘊，謂乃至死恒隨轉法；三者窮生死蘊，\n謂乃至得金剛喻定恒隨轉法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以彼執冥性勝性皆\n實有故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《仁王護國\n般若經》云：「眾生識初一念異木石，生得善，生得惡。惡為無量惡識本，善為無量善識本。」《集論》二中說十三\n善法：一、自性善，即信等十一心所，乃至十三等流善等。今生得善，即第七生得善也。何等生得善？謂即彼\n\n諸善法，由先串習故，感得如是報。由此自性，即於是處不由思惟，任運樂住。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "染污善心者，謂能愛味名為染污，有等至故名為善也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於無色界"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂無漏心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂生無漏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂有漏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一切永滅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼趣所攝異熟無故，不由功用，自然\n應得無餘涅槃能治現前，一切所治皆永斷故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": "cf1", "text": "X50n0821_p0690a03"}
{"id": null, "n": "0829001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0829001", "type": "orig", "text": "身上疑脫舌字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0829002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0829002", "type": "orig", "text": "論疑詮"}
{"id": null, "n": "0831001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0831001", "type": "orig", "text": "薩疑提"}
{"id": null, "n": "0833001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0833001", "type": "orig", "text": "賞疑勞"}
{"id": null, "n": "0840001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0840001", "type": "orig", "text": "四下疑脫大字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0840002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0840002", "type": "orig", "text": "二疑三"}
{"id": null, "n": "0867001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0867001", "type": "orig", "text": "剎下疑脫那字"}
{"id": null, "n": "0878001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0878001", "type": "orig", "text": "就是非疑非就是"}
{"id": null, "n": "0829a1101", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0829a1101", "type": "add", "text": "己【CB】，巳【卍續】"}
